Daikin Remote

The Daikin IR protocol encoders in app/lib/protocol/ are a Dart port of the byte layouts,
timings and checksums from IRremoteESP8266
(https://github.com/crankyoldgit/IRremoteESP8266, src/ir_Daikin.cpp / ir_Daikin.h),
Copyright 2016-2022 sillyfrog, crankyoldgit, pasna and contributors, licensed under the
GNU Lesser General Public License v2.1. Test vectors in app/test/ come from that
project's test/ir_Daikin_test.cpp.

The IR bridge firmware in firmware/daikin-ir-bridge/ links IRremoteESP8266 (LGPL v2.1).
